1","e":"tech","d":"2020-11-08","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Chuck Kummeth","x":"We are currently rolling out additional direct-to-consumer advertising with Mr. Ripken, including a sports radio advertising campaign and WebMD patient advertising.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2021 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2021-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chuck Kummeth","x":"Private payers are increasingly recognizing the patient benefits and cost savings ExoDx Prostate delivers by avoiding unnecessary biopsies as well as the strong dossier of data we have supporting the efficacy and clinical utility of the test.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2022 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"On the inflationary aspect of it, we're trying to manage that through combination of productivity as well as selected price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2022 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chuck Kummeth","x":"I don't think there is an upside beyond the steady state we're at right now but if inflation continues to happen, well then, we'll continue to raise prices like everybody else.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2022 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2022-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Nowak","x":"So did I hear you correctly that you are in fact, pushing some price increases through on the core kits and reagents business and this is -- how much headroom do you have there before that worry about competition?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2022 Q4","e":"tech","d":"2022-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chuck Kummeth","x":"We have been strategically implementing price increases throughout our portfolio to offset our exposure to rising costs, including labor, and will continue to pull this lever going forward.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2023 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2022-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"Speaking of inflation, the businesses implemented strategic price increases during the quarter to offset the dollar impact of inflation on operating income; however, the dollar-for-dollar offset did have a negative impact on operating margin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2023 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2022-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chuck Kummeth","x":"The team has done an extraordinary job strategically implementing price increases across the portfolio to offset the impact of inflation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2023 Q2","e":"tech","d":"2023-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"The business has implemented strategic price increases during the first half of fiscal year 2023 to offset the dollar impact of inflation and operating income.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2023 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2023-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"The business has implemented strategic price increases during the first half of fiscal year 2023 to offset the dollar impact of inflation to operating income, with pricing largely offsetting the inflation impact on our operating margin as well in Q3.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2023 Q4","e":"tech","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"The businesses implemented strategic price increases during the first half of fiscal year 2023 to offset the dollar impact of inflation to operating income with pricing also largely offsetting the inflation impact on our operating margin in Q4.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2024 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2023-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Hippel","x":"The price increases implemented during the first half of fiscal year '23 continue to offset the dollar impact of inflation to operating income with pricing also largely offsetting the inflationary impact in our operating margin in Q1.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2024 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2023-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Charles Kummeth","x":"Don't know of any real layoffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2024 Q2","e":"tech","d":"2024-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Hippel","x":"The price increases implemented during fiscal year '23 continue to offset the dollar impact of inflation to operating income, with pricing also largely offsetting the inflationary impact on our operating margin in Q2.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2024 Q2","e":"tech","d":"2024-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jacob Johnson","x":"I think there was a restructuring charge in the quarter as well.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"…wildcard in this outlook, but we believe calendar 2025 has the potential to be a year of more normal levels of pharma R&D spend as greater clarity on the IRA impact as well as recent project rationalization and restructuring initiatives clear the path for new investments by these customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jacob Johnson","x":"I think there's maybe a restructuring charge in there and then obviously the return of incentive comp.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q2","e":"tech","d":"2025-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kim Kelderman","x":"On our installed base, customers continue to appreciate the labor and cost savings these innovative platforms bring to their laboratories.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q2","e":"tech","d":"2025-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"The increase in SG and A was driven primarily by the reinstatement of incentive compensation partially offset by the benefit of structural streamlining and diligent expense control.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"In summary, Q3 was a solid quarter overall and our teams executed extremely well, especially considering the turbulent market conditions induced by NIH funding and tariff uncertainties.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2025-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"However, as we approach the finish of our fiscal year, there was no way to predict last July that our market will be facing the uncertainties of future NIH funding and tariffs that we are now experiencing.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2025-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim Hippel","x":"The decrease in SG&A and R&D was driven primarily by the benefit of structural streamlining and diligent expense control, which was partially offset by ongoing strategic growth initiatives.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2025 Q3","e":"tech","d":"2025-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kim Kelderman","x":"But then in the meantime, they are positioned to automate very clunky yet fundamental processes in your laboratories and basically take cost out and increase your efficiencies which might be something that you really would like during times of constraints.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TECH 2026 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James T. Hippel","x":"Importantly, unlike last quarter, the instrument growth does not appear to be driven by tariff-related dynamics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/bio-techne-tech-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TECH 2026 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2025-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James T. Hippel","x":"In summary, the team delivered strong execution in Q1 despite persistent market headwinds, including biotech funding pressures, NIH budget uncertainty, and lingering tariff concerns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/bio-techne-tech-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TECH 2026 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James T. Hippel","x":"This consistency reflects the benefits of structural streamlining and disciplined expense management, partially offset by targeted investments in strategic growth initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/bio-techne-tech-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TECH 2026 Q1","e":"tech","d":"2025-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James T. Hippel","x":"So we initiated some new streamlining activities this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/bio-techne-tech-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TECH 2026 Q2","e":"tech","d":"2026-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James T. Hippel","x":"The operating leverage reflects the benefits of structural st